&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program managers and manufacturing leadership in preparation and management of critical technical and business forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structure to ambiguity and helping drive manufacturing engineering stakeholders towards decisions on tactical and strategic issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategies to drive business impact and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis and Reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute scrappy analyses on short-timelines to get answers quickly, while also considering more scalable solutions that will make Anduril successful in the long term&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze manufacturing data to identify trends, patterns, and areas for improvement manufacturing processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate data-driven decision-making by providing timely and accurate manufacturing information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems and Processes Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an understanding of how our manufacturing engineering systems (ERP, MRP, PLM etc.) function and how to leverage data from them to equip manufacturing engineering teams with insights and tools to make tactical and strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze best practices across teams and develop ways to standardize and implement across all teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the documentation and standardization of business procedures and reporting protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in engineering, data science, business, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a manufacturing environment, with a focus on data analysis, program support, or process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical aptitude and can intuitively think about problems in terms of numbers and data-models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication abilities, with the capacity to present complex data clearly to diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reliable self-starter, highly organized, resourceful, with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be a U.S. Person due to required access to U.S. export controlled information or facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MES, ERP, and PLM systems and how they interface with each other and with operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Confluence/JIRA, SharePoint and Airtable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL, Typescript, PowerBI, Tableau, Foundry, Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
