&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Valar Atomics,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;building the future of clean energy, and we need hardworking individuals who enjoy working with their hands and being part of a team that is making a real impact. As a Skilled Laborer,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;support a variety of construction, facility, and site operations projects while working alongside experienced tradespeople and industry professionals. This is an excellent opportunity for someone who takes pride in quality work, enjoys learning new skills, and wants to be part of a fast-paced, mission-driven environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
