&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hickory&lt;/strong&gt; - Ashe, Burke, Caldwell, Catawba, Cleveland, Iredell, Lincoln, McDowell, Mitchell, Watauga&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;How BAYADA Supports Your Success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Efficient onboarding that works around your availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalized, paid training, including our award-winning SIM labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill-building to prepare you for a wide range of clients and acuity levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 clinical support and ongoing mentorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User-friendly electronic charting through Cubhub so you can focus on patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;What You Need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active LPN license (Licensed Practical Nurse) in the state of North Carolina&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduation from an accredited nursing program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to make a difference as an LPN?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Join our compassionate home care team in North Carolina – apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SER-Piedmont&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
